# ============================================================================
# Databases: the databases a project uses, and what this computer can connect
# to (its ODBC drivers and data sources). Settings > Databases, or double-click
# a database in the project tree. An address is a line of text in the project
# file, so a password need not be in it: PWD=? asks when the app connects, and
# ${NAME} reads an environment variable.
# ============================================================================

@Window Databases
Title=Databases
Width=900
Height=640
Resizable=false
BorderBrush=#1E3A8A
OnOpened=DbScreenLoad

@DockPanel DbRoot
Parent=Databases

@Border DbHeader
Parent=DbRoot
DockPanel.Dock=Top
Background=#1E3A8A
Padding=12,8

@TextBlock lblDbTitle
Parent=DbHeader
Text=Databases
FontSize=14
FontWeight=Bold
Foreground=White

